<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLAND FACE SOUTH AFRICA FOR FIRST TIME.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLAND FACE SOUTH AFRICA FOR FIRST TIME.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>England will play South Africa for the first time in a soccer international in Manchester on May 24, BBC radio reported on Monday.</p>
<p>England will use the friendly against the African champions at Old Trafford as part of their build-up for a World Cup clash in Poland on May 31.</p>
